    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d100-a2">

                <pb facs="0359" n="989" sameAs="frus:frus1873p1v2/pg989"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Appendix referred to in the foregoing
                        note.—Translation</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Havana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1873-05-03T17:00:00-05:29"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 3, 5
                            p.m.</date> (Received May 4, 11 a.m.)</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>To the <hi rendition="#small-caps">Minister of State</hi>:</p>
                <p>O’Kelly comes to Havana under full guarantees. All consideration shown him. His
                    case not forejudged. Will be brought before ordinary tribunal. Information about
                    Santa Rosa another day.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>PIELTAIN.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
